1
00:00:01,801 --> 00:00:03,036
I learned so much from you.

2
00:00:04,037 --> 00:00:05,372
You'll do well.

3
00:00:07,073 --> 00:00:08,975
I'll be off then. Bye!

4
00:00:08,975 --> 00:00:10,844
- Goodbye!
- Goodbye...

5
00:00:13,980 --> 00:00:15,115
Don't cry now.

6
00:00:15,115 --> 00:00:17,075
Your eyes are going to swell
before the interview.

7
00:00:17,217 --> 00:00:19,352
How could you not cry?

8
00:00:20,186 --> 00:00:21,988
Why would you cry over
these things?

9
00:00:24,391 --> 00:00:27,193
And just like that,
Hye-won left the Jude Flower.

10
00:00:27,427 --> 00:00:28,795
And today is...

11
00:00:28,795 --> 00:00:30,764
the day of the greatly
anticipated interview.

12
00:00:32,966 --> 00:00:34,167
Look at the people.

13
00:00:46,813 --> 00:00:48,481
Feeling better now?

14
00:00:48,481 --> 00:00:50,583
Yeah, much better.

15
00:00:54,921 --> 00:00:55,955
Let's do our best.

16
00:00:56,389 --> 00:00:57,557
Yes, lets.

17
00:01:02,695 --> 00:01:04,030
Ok, we're ready to shoot.

18
00:01:04,030 --> 00:01:05,899
Could the two of you
come this way?

19
00:01:05,899 --> 00:01:06,899
Ok.
